abstract: >-
  A config-driven R/Bioconductor pipeline integrating limma differential expression,
  signed WGCNA co-expression module detection, fgsea cancer pathway enrichment, and
  Cox proportional hazards / Kaplan-Meier overall survival modeling on public TCGA
  cohorts via UCSC Xena.
